<title>USA: TABLE-First Brands Corp Q4 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE-First Brands Corp Q4 results.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.04		    $0.43</p>
<p> Net			  1,453		   18,241</p>
<p> Revs		     319,463		  296,942</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  41,222		   42,686</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.20		    $1.53</p>
<p> Net			 50,232		   65,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,119,898		1,073,022</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  41,757		   42,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: All periods ended JUne 30.</p>
<p>The Q4 1997 and FY 1997 results reflect a $19 million pretax restructuring charge, equivalent to $0.28 per share after-tax.</p>
<p>On an operating basis, without those charges, Q4 1997 earnings were $0.32 per share.</p>
